    "body": "Do you mean the private BluetoothGattDescriptor which represents the per-client instance of the CCCD that the peripheral keeps for that specific application? If I understand you correctly, then given a UA acting as the central, all applications running locally would have to share the same CCCD, so different apps won't have private GATT descriptors.\n\nThough correct me if you meant something else.\n",
